### All nodes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nodes

### Filter by district
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nodes?district=Kallio

### Existing node
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nodes/1

### Missing node: deliberate latent NPE in the baseline
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nodes/999

### Signals: some payloads are null
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nodes/1/signals

### Register a node
POST http://localhost:8080/api/nodes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codename": "LUMEN-9",
  "district": "Ruoholahti",
  "alias": null,
  "operator": "Aster Grid"
}
